<title>JAPAN: Hitachi, others to cooperate on Internet shopping.</title>
<headline>Hitachi, others to cooperate on Internet shopping.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hitachi Ltd said on Monday that it, Fujitsu Ltd and NEC Corp are joining hands to develop infrastructure for electronic shopping over the Internet.</p>
<p>The companies will set up a joint venture with financial institutions as early as October to provide identification services essential to electronic commerce, a Hitachi spokesman said.</p>
<p>The companies will also cooperate in developing systems and hardware for on-line shopping, including integrated circuit (IC) cards capable of handling electronic payments.</p>
</text>
